      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The team from Harbour Energy were great to work with. They missed my solarquotes' enquiry but were swift to get in touch and quote after the solarquotes' follow up. Their quote came out best $/kWh and their communication was fast and professional. Their quote was conservative about the number of pannels I caould fit, but their install team requoted for a great maximum. They had a scheduled spot come up and were available in under 2 weeks.  I have an old house with a few quirks you find as you go - the install team were super supportive and helpful with the requirements of the tile and colourbond roof combination. The install took longer than planned, but the team worked on all available days until complete with good communication during. The team even installed an additional hot water timer and gave some further energy advice. Their support team are still fielding my detailed metering questions. I rate them and have recommended them to neighbours who are following suit.",
